  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "Lighting sets the mood and atmosphere of your scene. Unity's
      default <b>Directional Light</b> \u2014 which acts like the sun in the real
      world \u2014 simulates bright, midday sunlight. \n\nBy rotating this light,
      you can simulate different times of day or specific lighting conditions."
