  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'A <b>skybox</b> in Unity is a type of virtual backdrop that
      surrounds the entire scene, giving the illusion of a distant environment or
      sky around the environment you create.


      The skybox contributes a lot
      to the overall feel of your scene.'
